## ============================================================================
## OVERVIEW
## ============================================================================

This manifest contains all developments made on the laptop since 6am today:

1. LLMLingua Auto-Start Integration
2. FastAPI JWT Authentication System (FIRE workflow result)
3. Git Branch Strategy with device-specific configurations
4. SuperClaude Integration
5. Enhanced agent configurations
6. Quality standards and testing frameworks

Total Files: 60+
New Services: 2 (LLMLingua, SuperClaude)
New Branches: laptop-dev (to be replicated as desktop-dev)

## ============================================================================
## PRE-REQUISITES
## ============================================================================

REQUIRED_PYTHON_VERSION=3.11+
REQUIRED_GIT_VERSION=2.30+
REQUIRED_DISK_SPACE=500MB
REQUIRED_MEMORY=2GB

# Desktop-specific paths (adjust as needed)
DESKTOP_USER=scott
DESKTOP_HOME=/home/scott
